     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><font face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\">Hello everyone</span></font><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><font face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\"><br></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><font face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\">This question is designed for GIS users who use the R tool for GIS -arcgisbinding package.</span><br></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">I added a GIS application that calls an R script. The script performs various calculations and produces a graph. GIS read the application from my computer.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">I wish that the GIS will call the script from the network rather than from a computer.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">There is any option to call Shiny application form the GIS?<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">If not, is there a possibility that the GIS will call the script from a server not have installed R.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"text-align:-webkit-right\">Many thanks in advance</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"text-align:-webkit-right\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"text-align:-webkit-right\">Yoni Isaac</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"text-align:-webkit-right\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"right\" dir=\"RTL\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></span></p></div>"
